      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding is that IBluetooth{Media|Telephony} are Floss local interfaces while IBluetooth{Media|Telephony}Callback are remote interface (RPCProxy) to remote objects.\nAs `on_telphony_use` is a CRAS method, I think it should be in IBluetoothTelephonyCallback.\nDo I misunderstand it?",
