      "writtenOn": "2023-10-06T12:26:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`register_telephony_callback` belongs to `IBluetoothTelephony` and `on_telphony_use` belongs to `IBluetoothTelephonyCallback`. I don\u0027t think there\u0027s a collision.\n\nTo Floss\u0027s clients (e.g. CRAS), IBluetoothMedia/Callback and IBluetoothTelephony/Callback are 2 sets of APIs and they should not be coupled. That is, IBluetoothMedia controls media features and may generate some IBluetoothMediaCallback; While IBluetoothTelephony controls telephony features and may generate some IBluetoothTelephonyCallback.",
